@host = http://localhost:5250

### Create company
POST {{host}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme", "website": "https://acme.io", "country": "Netherlands" }

### List companies
GET {{host}}/api/companies

### Create application
POST {{host}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Acme",
  "position": "Senior .NET Engineer",
  "workMode": "Remote",
  "salary": { "min": 80000, "max": 95000, "currency": "EUR", "period": "Yearly" },
  "status": "Applied"
}

### List remote applications in interview stage
GET {{host}}/api/applications?workMode=Remote&status=Interview
